details:
Example
Set a command-failure message with notify_fail(); it is triggered after return 0;.

int main(object me, string arg)
{
    notify_fail("这里是指令执行失败的提示……");
    return 0;
}

The recommended form is:

int main(object me, string arg)
{
    return notify_fail("这里是指令执行失败的提示……");
}

Return semantics:
notify_fail() always returns 0.
